{"title":"Cozy Craft Circle","startsAt":"2026-10-19T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-19T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Cozy Crafting Circle: Bring Your Own Craft (BYOC)**\n\n**When:** Every 3rd Monday of each month \\| 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM\n\n**Where:** The Cups at Yonge and Finch\n\n**Who:** Open to everyone! All ages, skill levels, nationalities, and genders welcome.\n\nGrab your favorite warm drink and join us for our weekly Monday afternoon craft session!\n\nOur **Cozy Crafting Circle** is a friendly, low-pressure, and inspiring space designed for local makers to come together, connect, and create. Work on whatever portable project you currently have on the go—knitting, crochet, mending, sketching, embroidery, journaling, beadwork, or paper crafts!\n\n**What to Expect:**\n\n* **Casual Socializing:** Connect with artistic and like-minded people from around Vaughan, Thornhill, and Toronto in a relaxed setting.\n* **Skill Sharing:** Want to learn a new stitch or troubleshoot a project? Our circle is built on community collaboration—feel free to ask questions and swap creative tips!\n* **Cozy Vibes:** Enjoy the wonderful atmosphere, signature drinks, and delicious treats at The Cups cafe while you craft.\n\n*Note: Please support our fantastic host venue by purchasing a beverage or treat during the event!*\n\nBring your current project, enjoy the cozy company, and let's create together!\n\nOptional: Have extra magazines, paper scraps, or craft supplies laying around? Feel free to bring them to share or trade!","venue":{"name":"The Cups (Finch)","address":"5647 Yonge St, North York, ON M2M 3T2, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.7812,"lng":-79.41558,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Cozy Craft Circle","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/5/b/b/highres_536134235.jpeg"}